    "name": "Dragons Frolic!",
    "steam_appid": 3670290,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/9a5b8b5d47676d4a2cdff52a702c8a7e.avif?t=1749369541\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dragons Frolic!</strong> you collect little dragons, which you can enter into dragon races.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They'd love to find a home on your second monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your character.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute little dragons frolicking around you!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different types of dragons and their color variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your dragons sheds.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed, raise and sell dragons.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your favorite dragons into races and collect treasure.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Races are side-scrollers! Compete in different modes. Beat a level as fast as you can to set a new highscore or keep on running for as long as possible, without colliding with obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.poster.avif?t=1749369541\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.apng?t=1749369541\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/9a5b8b5d47676d4a2cdff52a702c8a7e.avif?t=1749369541\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dragons Frolic!</strong> you collect little dragons, which you can enter into dragon races.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They'd love to find a home on your second monitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise your character.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy cute little dragons frolicking around you!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover different types of dragons and their color variations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your dragons sheds.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed, raise and sell dragons.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send your favorite dragons into races and collect treasure.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Races are side-scrollers! Compete in different modes. Beat a level as fast as you can to set a new highscore or keep on running for as long as possible, without colliding with obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.poster.avif?t=1749369541\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670290/extras/6538d92cbafeecfde995699cc000862c.apng?t=1749369541\" class=\"bb_img\" width=256 height=128 /></picture></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dragons Frolic! is a cozy and relaxing idle game with a cute racing platformer on top! Buy or breed dragons, sell them for profit or send them into races. Discover new dragon types and color variants. Unlock new decorations. These cute dragons would love to frolic on your second monitor!",
